    "study design, and does not select acceptance criteria, thresholds or margins. Narrative "
    "sections are machine-drafted and must be reviewed by the manufacturer's qualified "
    "statistician and regulatory lead before use. Guidance references: {guidance_refs}. "
    "This output is not a regulatory opinion; no regulator has endorsed this tool."
